 275:source\asw/mp3.c **** /**
 276:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * \brief Player state machine, processes ONE event (tsk_control).
 277:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *
 278:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * Events, actions (function calls) and state changes are all visible in the
 279:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * switch below. While stopped without songs all events are ignored. Any button
 280:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * press clears a displayed error (N8).
 281:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *
 282:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * \param[in] nextEvent  single event bit: ev_Button1..ev_Button4 or ev_1s; other values are ignore
 283:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * \return RC_SUCCESS always
